  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag2.27" class="h1">Thag 2:27  Nandaka</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Just as a fine thoroughbred steed</p>
              <p>stumbling, regains its stance,</p>
              <p>feeling all the more urgency,</p>
              <p>&amp; draws its burden</p>
              <p class="v2">undaunted.</p>
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p>In the same way, remember me:</p>
                <p>consummate in vision,</p>
                <p>a disciple of the Rightly</p>
                <p>Self-awakened One,</p>
                <p>the Awakened One’s thoroughbred child,</p>
                <p class="v4">his son.</p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../../MN/MN146.html">MN 146</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
